{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odd Dorable is a game created from my 4-year-old daughter\u2019s drawings.</strong><br><br>Embark on a short, playful adventure through this cozy and welcoming open world filled with <strong>different puzzles to solve</strong>. Uncover <strong>hidden secrets</strong> and <strong>help the princess</strong> find all her lost candies. Rediscover your inner child as the game evokes a sense of wonder and curiosity. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/f0d2c63ff5f6dbc2f99ce291392ea6e7.poster.avif?t=1763755545\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/f0d2c63ff5f6dbc2f99ce291392ea6e7.webm?t=1763755545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/f0d2c63ff5f6dbc2f99ce291392ea6e7.mp4?t=1763755545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 Around 30 minutes to 1 hour of playtime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2601\ufe0f Step into a world of pure imagination, lovingly crafted together with my daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Explore different playful locations and solve puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2a Meet a small cast of quirky characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 Find all six magic candies and help the princess reclaim her magical powers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/fb840bd37730393d366abf93675528c3.poster.avif?t=1763755545\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/fb840bd37730393d366abf93675528c3.webm?t=1763755545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/fb840bd37730393d366abf93675528c3.mp4?t=1763755545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This game uses visual storytelling, so no language is needed to play and fully enjoy the experience.</strong></i><br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Attention:</strong> This game is digestible \ud83d\ude0b\ud83c\udf74<br><br>A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn\u2019t overstay its welcome. We want you to be able to finish our games in just a short session without ever making you feel stuffed, so to say.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blue Candy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3690890/655b7e3041d7a74af8071adbfd6e27d7b4af0c0f.jpg"},{"name":"Pink Candy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3690890/4cdd567ed9d5af309b9845dddc9bed2addaf4f9d.jpg"},{"name":"Different pink candy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3690890/4ed1987818f77f3e04fa013533843d813744f509.jpg"},{"name":"Green candy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3690890/81de8d2be6ce6eb0ec9960825d9df9c1de7f904f.jpg"},{"name":"Red candy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3690890/881e72ab72f68eab504c4b7b5ab1dd3ff4cdafcc.jpg"},{"name":"Lollipop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3690890/46660ddab2d19387b41886a361bf4503f4eaca10.jpg"},{"name":"Key to the end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3690890/1028c1a73958785526fde07491aefd6785c602d8.jpg"},{"name":"Dorable Kombat!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/369